WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:23.230
Champions will gather here with the title of Duel King at stake.

00:01:27.990 --> 00:01:30.240
Battle Ship, take off!

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:47.290
The first match will now begin.

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:51.520
Duelists, report to the hall.

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:00.770
Let's go, partner.

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:01.300
Yeah!

00:02:01.530 --> 00:02:07.540
First Duel in the Sky
Yugi vs Yami Bakura

00:02:15.790 --> 00:02:17.980
It's the finals, Yugi.

00:02:17.980 --> 00:02:18.420
Yeah.

00:02:18.730 --> 00:02:21.350
I will defeat you this time.

00:02:21.350 --> 00:02:24.090
Our duel will be fair and square.

00:02:24.090 --> 00:02:25.260
Of course.

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:28.960
Delicious!  That looks good too!

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:31.420
Shizuka, this is tasty!

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:37.870
That punk Marik, I'll pay you back in a duel!

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:42.820
Remember that!

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:44.170
Oops!

00:02:44.170 --> 00:02:45.460
Sorry!

00:02:45.460 --> 00:02:46.810
Bakura.

00:02:47.050 --> 00:02:50.120
I'm kinda nervous, Jonouchi.

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:50.940
Yeah.

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:53.920
By the way, what deck are you using?

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:57.660
My deck is an Occult Deck.

00:02:57.860 --> 00:02:59.730
Occult Deck?

00:02:59.730 --> 00:03:03.000
Is it like Kotsuzuka's Ghost Deck?

00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:08.680
Bakura is also using a creepy deck?

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:19.020
I dueled Kotsuzuka.  It was an easy win.

00:03:19.770 --> 00:03:21.640
You beat Kotsuzuka easily?

00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:22.210
Yeah.

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:26.640
If he beat Kotsuzuka easily, his Occult Deck must be powerful.

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:28.150
Well, see ya.

00:03:28.150 --> 00:03:31.160
If we have to duel each other, let's have fun.

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:33.590
I don't want to duel him...

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:36.440
What's wrong?  You look pale.

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:37.710
I-It's nothing.

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:39.200
I'm just nervous.

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:40.530
Are you okay, brother?

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:42.660
Hey Kaiba.

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:45.210
How are you choosing the matchups?

00:03:45.640 --> 00:03:48.310
Can't you be patient?

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:50.740
Why haven't we started?

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:55.180
The eighth duelist hasn't arrived yet.

00:03:55.350 --> 00:03:56.470
I don't care.

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:57.850
Begin!

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:04.350
What's that?

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:20.170
The first match will be determined via lottery.

00:04:20.170 --> 00:04:21.770
Lottery?

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:26.680
The lottery will choose the first two competitors to duel.

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:31.620
We'll use this Ultimate Bingo Machine.

00:04:32.150 --> 00:04:36.170
When we have a winner, we'll hold the lottery again.

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:40.880
In other words, you won't know your opponent until the last minute.

00:04:41.110 --> 00:04:43.530
So that was a bingo machine?

00:04:43.530 --> 00:04:44.800
He has bad taste.

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:50.520
This bingo machine contains eight balls, one for each duelist.

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:52.740
It will select two balls at random.

00:05:03.370 --> 00:05:04.110
Come in.

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:06.590
Excuse me.

00:05:07.390 --> 00:05:10.050
No. 8, please come to the hall.

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:14.060
I know when each duelist will duel.

00:05:15.700 --> 00:05:18.100
I will duel in the fourth match.

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:23.530
You may not believe me, but I can see the future.

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:29.170
In the first match, the evil spirit will attack him.

00:05:29.460 --> 00:05:33.460
Let's start the lottery for the first match.

00:05:33.460 --> 00:05:36.660
Ultimate Bingo, start!

00:05:45.220 --> 00:05:47.510
The first duelist is...

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:50.460
Duelist No. 6!

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:52.400
Ryo Bakura!

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:54.220
What?  Me?

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:55.840
You're first, Bakura!

00:05:57.260 --> 00:06:00.040
Are you healthy enough?

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:01.560
You don't look well.

00:06:01.780 --> 00:06:05.530
Yeah.  You should rest up in your room.

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:08.150
I really don't want to duel him.

00:06:08.150 --> 00:06:09.280
So rest up!

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:11.710
I'm fine now.

00:06:11.710 --> 00:06:14.950
Being in the first match makes me nervous.

00:06:15.280 --> 00:06:17.890
Who will be the other duelist?

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:29.970
Ryo Bakura's opponent in the first match is...

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:34.300
Duelist No. 3!  Yugi Muto!

00:06:34.770 --> 00:06:38.400
Ryo Bakura vs Yugi Muto!

00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:40.460
What?  I'm dueling Yugi?

00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:41.840
I'm in trouble.

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:42.850
Bakura...

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:48.180
Ryo Bakura, let's see how skilled you are as a duelist.

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:50.580
I'm glad it wasn't me.

00:06:50.580 --> 00:06:54.150
Bakura, how unlucky that you have to face Yugi.

00:06:54.150 --> 00:06:56.990
We already know who'll win.

00:06:56.990 --> 00:06:59.000
C'mon, don't say that.

00:06:59.860 --> 00:07:02.060
Don't be so sure.

00:07:02.530 --> 00:07:05.100
He has a Millennium Item.

00:07:06.930 --> 00:07:10.410
The millennium battle begins with the first match.

00:07:10.620 --> 00:07:14.580
This battle will be his first test.

00:07:18.220 --> 00:07:22.680
Yugi, I'm happy that I can duel you first.

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:29.760
The tournament will be held at the Battle Ship's special Duel Ring - the Sky Duel Field!

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:31.730
Sky Duel Field?

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:36.200
Competitors, take the central elevator to the Duel Field.

00:07:36.550 --> 00:07:39.200
The others are free to watch.

00:07:39.440 --> 00:07:40.850
Let's go!

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:41.640
Of course!

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:49.620
If the evil spirit is controlling Bakura's heart...

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:56.020
This duel will be very dangerous.

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:19.250
This is the Sky Duel Field.

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:23.750
We duel here?

00:08:41.170 --> 00:08:43.120
That's the Sky Duel Field.

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:44.580
It's cold.

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:47.340
They have to duel under strong winds?

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:52.100
The Battle Ship is at an altitude of 1000 meters.

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:58.780
The sudden gusts are sharp enough to cut and hurt the duelists.

00:08:58.980 --> 00:09:02.620
You must fight under these harsh conditions.

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:05.560
I'm getting excited!

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:08.760
It's a spectacle worthy of the finals!

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:18.540
Reveal your true identity.

00:09:18.760 --> 00:09:20.600
You're not Bakura.

00:09:22.850 --> 00:09:26.180
You're the evil who lives inside the Millennium Ring!

00:09:32.580 --> 00:09:33.820
I knew it.

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:35.630
The Millennium Ring?

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:36.940
What an idiot!

00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:38.660
He wore that thing again?

00:09:38.660 --> 00:09:43.080
Impossible!  I threw that Ring away!

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:51.650
How did Bakura get it back?

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:54.850
What's going on?

00:09:54.850 --> 00:09:56.540
What's a Millennium Ring?

00:09:56.880 --> 00:10:01.100
Oh yeah.  Namu doesn't know anything.

00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:02.080
Me neither.

00:10:02.270 --> 00:10:07.580
Bakura's dad bought him the Millennium Ring in Egypt as a souvenir.

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:10.520
When he wore it, a dark spirit took over.

00:10:10.520 --> 00:10:12.950
That's the Millennium Ring.

00:10:13.160 --> 00:10:17.450
So the dark spirit is controlling him again?

00:10:17.450 --> 00:10:18.960
That's hard to believe.

00:10:19.180 --> 00:10:21.630
It's hard for me to believe too.

00:10:22.740 --> 00:10:25.240
I have a bad feeling about this duel.

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:26.400
Brother...

00:10:27.820 --> 00:10:33.260
One correction: There's more than one person controlling Bakura.

00:10:33.260 --> 00:10:34.860
There are two.

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:40.680
Yugi, we haven't fought since our Shadow Game at Duelist Kingdom.

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:45.930
What are you planning to do by taking over Bakura's body again?

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:48.300
Are you after my Millennium Puzzle?

00:10:49.100 --> 00:10:50.130
Who knows.

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:56.310
Yugi, you must stay alive until you open the door to the darkness.

00:10:56.310 --> 00:10:58.570
Because you hold the Millennium Puzzle.

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:03.660
The Millennium Puzzle is the final piece I need to get the evil power.

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:05.510
But I don't need it yet.

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:07.400
Not yet.

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:15.060
Yugi, there's only one reason why I entered this tournament.

00:11:15.060 --> 00:11:16.880
Your God Card.

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:18.820
God Card?

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:20.820
Why does he want Slifer?

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:22.720
The reason is simple.

00:11:22.720 --> 00:11:31.020
If I want to rule the game world, I must win this tournament and get the title of Duel King.

00:11:31.020 --> 00:11:34.050
I don't think that's his only reason.

00:11:34.050 --> 00:11:35.640
There's something else.

00:11:35.640 --> 00:11:37.210
What does he want?

00:11:37.400 --> 00:11:41.400
I don't think he believes me, but that's fine.

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:43.520
I made an agreement with Marik.

00:11:43.780 --> 00:11:48.080
If I give him Slifer, he gives me the Millennium Rod.

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:55.960
If you want, I'm willing to take control of your body and defeat Yugi.

00:11:56.400 --> 00:12:01.020
Stay back!  You already lost to Yugi, so stop acting superior!

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:02.900
I'll defeat Yugi!

00:12:03.420 --> 00:12:07.700
Begin the first match of the Battle Ship finals!

00:12:08.510 --> 00:12:09.170
Duel!

00:12:11.360 --> 00:12:13.350
Yugi, don't lose!

00:12:13.350 --> 00:12:15.860
Change Bakura back to normal!

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:19.510
Yugi, destroy that weakling with your God Card!

00:12:20.080 --> 00:12:24.450
The millennium battle for the Pharaoh's title begins.

00:12:31.460 --> 00:12:35.060
Show me how your dueling skills have improved!

00:12:35.370 --> 00:12:38.070
Keep talking!  I go first!

00:12:38.280 --> 00:12:39.500
I draw a card!

00:12:57.220 --> 00:12:58.840
My turn!

00:12:59.240 --> 00:13:00.890
I play this in attack position!

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:07.760
I end my turn.

00:13:07.980 --> 00:13:12.200
It only has 1200 attack points, so why did he play it in attack position?

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:14.370
Does he want me to attack?

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:17.630
It doesn't seem to have a monster effect.

00:13:18.180 --> 00:13:20.110
Destroy that card, Yugi!

00:13:20.450 --> 00:13:22.040
My turn!

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:23.280
I draw!

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:25.620
I summon Gazelle the King of Mythical Beasts!

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:29.800
Attack The Portrait's Secret!

00:13:33.650 --> 00:13:34.590
It's destroyed!

00:13:37.140 --> 00:13:39.290
I set a card.

00:13:39.800 --> 00:13:41.230
I end my turn.

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:43.400
My turn!  I draw!

00:13:44.000 --> 00:13:46.770
The Gross Ghost of Fled Dreams in attack position!

00:13:53.050 --> 00:13:54.110
A ghost!

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:56.280
I end my turn.

00:13:56.760 --> 00:13:58.210
Attack position again?

00:13:59.070 --> 00:14:02.880
It's not like he set a trap or Counter Spell.

00:14:03.460 --> 00:14:07.680
What's the point of having your monsters destroyed?

00:14:12.360 --> 00:14:14.430
My turn!  I draw!

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:18.600
I attack with this monster!

00:14:21.310 --> 00:14:23.080
Gamma The Magnet Warrior!

00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:30.080
Use Magnet Punch to destroy The Gross Ghost of Fled Dreams!

00:14:30.350 --> 00:14:34.280
Next, Gazelle the King of Mythical Beasts attacks you directly!

00:14:41.250 --> 00:14:43.540
His monsters are dying in vain.

00:14:43.540 --> 00:14:45.540
Does he even want to duel?

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:49.030
It's like he doesn't know the basics of dueling.

00:14:49.260 --> 00:14:52.030
Bakura, do you have a strategy?

00:14:52.420 --> 00:14:54.630
My turn!  I draw!

00:14:59.800 --> 00:15:01.280
Attack position!

00:15:16.170 --> 00:15:17.960
Headless Knight!

00:15:17.960 --> 00:15:20.060
It's your turn.

00:15:20.800 --> 00:15:23.530
Destroy my monster, Yugi.

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:25.230
Again?

00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:30.840
I don't know what he's up to, but...

00:15:30.840 --> 00:15:33.840
Gamma The Magnet Warrior attacks!

00:15:36.510 --> 00:15:38.710
Headless Knight is destroyed!

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:41.680
I attack you directly!

00:15:50.740 --> 00:15:57.030
In three turns, Bakura lost three monsters with no resistance.

00:15:57.200 --> 00:15:59.800
This feels eerie.

00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:01.680
Is this his strategy?

00:16:01.680 --> 00:16:04.310
Or is he just bad?

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:07.410
Either way, Yugi will win next turn.

00:16:07.720 --> 00:16:09.080
I end my turn.

00:16:18.880 --> 00:16:20.350
Yugi!

00:16:20.800 --> 00:16:23.570
You fell for my trap!

00:16:23.820 --> 00:16:24.570
What?

00:16:24.970 --> 00:16:26.190
My turn!

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:27.630
I draw a card!

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:30.210
Trap?  That's nonsense!

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:32.800
Yugi has the advantage in this duel!

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:39.740
That's right!  Yugi has two monsters while Bakura has none.

00:16:40.010 --> 00:16:42.410
Is he bluffing?

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:46.180
Or does he have a plan to turn the tables?

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:51.850
My Occult Deck has a super scary card.

00:16:52.340 --> 00:16:57.850
But I have to use a special summoning method to summon that monster.

00:16:57.850 --> 00:16:59.640
Special method?

00:16:59.640 --> 00:17:00.490
Yes.

00:17:00.820 --> 00:17:07.940
I have to banish three Fiend-Type monsters from my graveyard to summon this monster.

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:11.480
Resurrect, the ruler of the afterlife!

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:13.140
Dark Necrofear!

00:17:32.180 --> 00:17:34.250
I summon Dark Necrofear!

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:36.380
I let my guard down.

00:17:36.380 --> 00:17:40.500
I didn't think he'd do that to summon a high-class monster.

00:17:42.960 --> 00:17:46.860
What is that?  It looks really gross.

00:17:46.860 --> 00:17:53.110
Why did he play his three monsters in attack position and lose life points?

00:17:53.480 --> 00:17:58.280
If he just needed to send them to the graveyard, he could've played them in defense position.

00:17:58.280 --> 00:18:01.190
That's why you're an ordinary duelist.

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:05.320
He played them in attack position so that Yugi would attack.

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:11.040
If he summoned them in defense, Yugi would be cautious of effects and might not attack.

00:18:12.570 --> 00:18:18.840
Yugi, I'll show you how terrifying my Occult Deck is.

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:24.580
He banished three monsters in his graveyard to summon it.

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:27.710
It's very creepy.

00:18:28.110 --> 00:18:34.540
To summon Dark Necrofear, Bakura had to lose a lot of life points.

00:18:34.540 --> 00:18:41.920
If he's willing to take a big risk to summon it, it must have terrifying effects.

00:18:41.920 --> 00:18:44.100
What will you do, Yugi?

00:18:44.880 --> 00:18:47.030
It's still my turn.

00:18:47.030 --> 00:18:48.920
I set two cards.

00:18:49.380 --> 00:18:51.120
I end my turn!

00:18:52.170 --> 00:18:59.250
Dark Necrofear can destroy my monster, so why doesn't he attack?

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:02.740
Is he worried about my set card?

00:19:04.210 --> 00:19:05.180
Or...

00:19:05.180 --> 00:19:07.320
What's wrong, Yugi?

00:19:07.320 --> 00:19:09.070
Attack me already.

00:19:09.900 --> 00:19:11.920
My turn!  I draw!

00:19:12.600 --> 00:19:15.570
I have all 4000 life points.

00:19:15.570 --> 00:19:17.670
Bakura has 450.

00:19:17.670 --> 00:19:19.970
I'll win with this card!

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:23.820
I tribute Gazelle the King of Mythical Beasts!

00:19:24.650 --> 00:19:27.550
To summon Dark Magician Girl!

00:19:37.850 --> 00:19:43.250
That little magician isn't strong enough to destroy Dark Necrofear.

00:19:43.250 --> 00:19:44.820
Are you sure?

00:19:44.820 --> 00:19:47.760
You thought my set card was a trap.

00:19:48.640 --> 00:19:49.690
It's not a trap?

00:19:49.690 --> 00:19:52.700
The card is Magic Formula!

00:19:54.720 --> 00:19:55.400
What?

00:19:58.040 --> 00:20:03.020
This card raises Dark Magician Girl's attack points by 500.

00:20:03.020 --> 00:20:07.210
Which is more than Dark Necrofear's 2200 attack points.

00:20:07.460 --> 00:20:08.940
Nice, Yugi!

00:20:08.940 --> 00:20:11.150
Destroy Bakura's creepy monster!

00:20:11.150 --> 00:20:14.150
Go, Dark Magician Girl!

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:17.030
Attack!  Black Burning!

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:27.960
Dark Necrofear is buried!

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:32.880
All right!

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:35.250
Hey, look.

00:20:36.100 --> 00:20:37.560
He's laughing.

00:20:38.640 --> 00:20:42.510
Thanks for destroying Dark Necrofear, Yugi.

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:50.300
When Dark Necrofear goes to the graveyard, I can activate the Field Spell Dark Sanctuary.

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:55.030
Field Spell?

00:21:08.880 --> 00:21:10.370
This is scary, Shizuka!

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:11.360
Brother!

00:21:19.110 --> 00:21:23.990
You've turned on the switch of the most terrifying occult combo.

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:25.420
What?

00:21:25.420 --> 00:21:30.500
Yugi, you'll taste how terrifying my occult combo is!

00:21:41.980 --> 00:21:48.920
Big trouble!  Dark Sanctuary has created a ghost that possesses Yugi's monsters!

00:21:49.220 --> 00:21:55.100
Every time Yugi attacks, the ghost takes away Yugi's life points and refills Bakura's!

00:21:55.100 --> 00:21:59.070
And Bakura finally activates his trump card - Destiny Board.

00:21:59.070 --> 00:22:06.520
What?  When it spells D-E-A-T-H, Yugi automatically loses?

00:22:06.520 --> 00:22:08.800
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Destiny Board Brings Death

00:22:08.800 --> 00:22:10.360
Duel, standby!

00:22:13.120 --> 00:22:21.030
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:21.030 --> 00:22:29.970
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:30.300 --> 00:22:34.940
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:34.940 --> 00:22:38.910
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:39.350 --> 00:22:46.890
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:46.890 --> 00:22:50.430
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:50.460 --> 00:22:55.230
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:55.230 --> 00:23:05.340
And walk it without stopping

00:23:05.340 --> 00:23:12.950
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:13.180 --> 00:23:21.920
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:21.920 --> 00:23:29.900
I want to trust myself
Sometimes I'll lose my way but

00:23:29.900 --> 00:23:39.740
I hide it in my heart...
Secret Paradise
